<title>MEXICO: Texas to Mexico livestock export update - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas to Mexico livestock export update - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Weekly livestock movement update of Texas exports to Mexico, to March 22 - USDA.</p>
<p>(Livestock per head, year in Jan/Dec calendar year)</p>
<p>	Beef			 Week	    Year    Year Ago</p>
<p>    Slaughter		     472	   29,698	9,743</p>
<p>    Breeding males		  0		708	  283</p>
<p>    Breeding females		0	    1,610	  265</p>
<p>	Hogs			 Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Slaughter			 0		410     29,200</p>
<p>    Breeding males		  0		162	   20</p>
<p>    Breeding females		0	    1,922	  287</p>
<p>	Dairy			Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Breeding males		  1		 57	   10</p>
<p>    Breeding females	    295	    7,109	1,388</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom (525) 7289530. E-mail at chris.aspin@reuters.com))</p>
